{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T00:37:09.900Z","ordinal":5048,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"call_FYhtHKtd5rPU4Ztp103TmGNj","server":"cua_repl","tool":"js","arguments":{"code":"await traceTab.click(229); await traceTab.getAXState();","title":"Verify structured prediction display"},"pluginId":"unified-computer-use@openai-bundled","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Browser tab: 3, Title: \"Trace — Robot observability\", URL: \"http://127.0.0.1:5174/\".\nThe following is a diff from the previous accessibility tree with ~ and + representing changed and added elements, respectively. Removed elements are summarized by ID range.\nRemoved element IDs: 229-230\n+\t\t\t\t\t239 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t240 button (expanded) Structured model prediction, Secondary Actions: Collapse\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t241 text Structured model prediction\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t242 text Only supported prediction fields are shown here. Generated evidence prose is retained only in the audit JSON and is not treated as an annotation or measurement. {\n  \"contact\": true,\n  \"event_type\": \"accidental\",\n  \"onset_ms\": 276,\n  \"strongest_joint\": \"J4\",\n  \"affected_joints\": [\n    \"J4\",\n    \"J1\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence_start_ms\": 295,\n  \"evidence_end_ms\": 325\n}\nThe focused UI element is 240 button (expanded) Structured model prediction, Secondary Actions: Collapse"}],"isError":false,"_meta":{"browser_use":{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:5174/"},"codex/browserUse":true,"codex/nodeReplExecutionDurationMs":374,"codex/toolSurface":{"backend":"iab","browserId":"1","kind":"browserUse","openTabIds":["3"],"screenshot":{"pageUrl":"http://127.0.0.1","tabId":"3","url":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"}}}},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":443392584}},"started_at_ms":1789259829457,"completed_at_ms":1789259829900}}
